title: "metRscreen: Title and Abstract Screening for Meta-Analyses and Systematic Reviews"
abstract: "A Shiny application for title and abstract screening, with multi-colour keyword highlighting, custom rejection reasons, and resumable sessions. Accepts Zotero CSV and RIS exports."
